  <p id="c-jinshu-004-huidi-opening:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-004-huidi-opening:p001:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAA">孝惠皇帝</persName>諱<persName id="c-jinshu-004-huidi-opening:p001:m0005" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAA">衷</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-004-huidi-opening:p001:m0008" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAA">正度</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-004-huidi-opening:p001:m0011" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIA">武帝</persName>第二子也。泰始三年，立爲<persName id="c-jinshu-004-huidi-opening:p001:m0025" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAA">皇太子</persName>，時年九歲。</p>
</text>
